stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: A termination hook waits for actual upload completion
accDescr: A bounded terminating wait includes the upload and result checks. Completion releases termination, but the overall hook can still expire under default behavior.
[*] --> InService
InService --> Waiting: Scale-in or replacement
state "Terminating:Wait" as Waiting {
  [*] --> Uploading
  state "SSM uploads local logs to S3" as Uploading
  Uploading --> Checking: Command submitted
  state "Poll execution, send heartbeats" as Checking
  Checking --> Uploading: Retry recoverable failure
  Checking --> [*]: Upload succeeded
}
Waiting --> Released: Complete with CONTINUE
Waiting --> Terminated: Hook expires, default behavior
Released --> Terminated: Remaining hooks complete
Terminated --> [*]
